SUMMARY:(1347) Patria hides a mag 11.8 star (just outside the path)
DESCRIPTION:(1347) Patria hides a magnitude 11.8 star\, seen from Kabul\, A
 F.\nThe predicted edge passes 15 km to the S\, so a miss is likely — but
  a chord from near the edge is the most valuable observation of all.\nClos
 est approach 18:34:22 +0430\, give or take 1 s. The star is 62° up in the
  SW · dusk.\nIt fades 4.4 magnitudes for up to 1.4 s on the centre line\,
  and the path is 32 km wide\, give or take 25 km.\nFinder chart\, the map 
 and the path as KML: https://occult.alokm.com/asteroids-2027-03#2027-03-16
